# SECTION 1 — PROJECT IDENTITY AND BUSINESS PROBLEM

## 1.1 Product identity

Product name: NiryatFlow AI

Product category: AI-powered export operations and financial intelligence platform.

Primary market: India.

Primary users: Indian MSME exporters, small export businesses and cross-border trading businesses.

Core concept:

"An intelligent export operating system that transforms an export order into a connected, trackable and financially understandable digital workflow."

## 1.2 Problem being addressed

Small and medium-sized exporters frequently manage export activities through disconnected tools, spreadsheets, documents and payment platforms.

This creates several difficulties:

- Export order information is scattered.
- Financial viability is difficult to calculate.
- Currency conversion introduces uncertainty.
- Payment charges affect actual profitability.
- Export documentation can become incomplete.
- Payment status and order status are disconnected.
- Business owners lack a unified view of export performance.
- Identifying the next action in an export order can be difficult.

NiryatFlow AI addresses these problems through one interconnected application.

## 1.3 Core value proposition

The user should be able to:

1. Create or import an export order.
2. Extract and organise relevant information using AI.
3. Validate the extracted order information.
4. Calculate financial viability using deterministic calculations.
5. Track document readiness.
6. Initiate and capture an international payment through PayPal Sandbox.
7. Monitor the complete export order lifecycle.
8. Understand business performance using actual order and payment records.

The entire workflow must be interconnected.

Information should not have to be repeatedly entered into different modules when it already exists in the application.

